te componentwise: f'(t)=⟨3,-1,7⟩ and g'(t)=⟨2t,-2t,1⟩. Their sum is ⟨2t+3,-2t-1,8⟩, original option a. The authentic worked solution and stored key agree. Saved grading rejected the submitted ⟨t+3,-t-1,8⟩; this review is a derived judgment, not a successful grade for option a."}] "usage" {"q-127998" [] "q-33122" [] "q-128570" [] "e-2478" [] "e-2479" [] "e-2480" [] "q-32503" [] "q-32286" [] "q-71225" [] "e-2477" [] "q-32866" []} "basis" 1708 "retractions" [[17592186115686 :question/problem "Differentiate $\\mathbf f(t)+\\mathbf g(t)$ with respect to $t$, where $$\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf f(t)&=\\langle3t-1,6-t,7t\\rangle,\\\\\\mathbf g(t)&=\\langle t^2,1-t^2,t\\rangle.\\end{aligned}$$"] [17592186115686 :question/worked-solution "Differentiate component by component: $\\mathbf f'(t)=\\langle3,-1,7\\rangle$ and $\\mathbf g'(t)=\\langle2t,-2t,1\\rangle$. By the sum rule, $$(\\mathbf f+\\mathbf g)'(t)=\\langle2t+3,-2t-1,8\\rangle.$$"] [17592186115686 :question/answer-fields 17592186113516] [17592186115675 :question/problem "Find $( u ( t ) \\mathbf{f} ( t ) {)}^{\\prime }$ where \n\n$$\n\\mathbf{f} ( t ) = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c}\\sin   t \\\\ 2 t - 8 \\\\ {5}^{t}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n and $u(t) = t^{2}$."] [17592186115675 :question/worked-solution "Use the product rule $(u\\mathbf f)'=u'\\mathbf f+u\\mathbf f'$. Here $u'=2t$ and $\\mathbf f'=\\langle\\cos t,2,5^t\\ln5\\rangle$, so $$(u\\mathbf f)'=\\begin{bmatrix}2t\\sin t+t^2\\cos t\\\\2t(2t-8)+2t^2\\\\2t5^t+t^25^t\\ln5\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}t^2\\cos t+2t\\sin t\\\\6t^2-16t\\\\5^tt^2\\ln5+2t5^t\\end{bmatrix}.$$"] [17592186115675 :question/difficulty 17592186045465] [17592186115685 :question/problem "If $\\mathbf f(u)=\\cos u\\,\\mathbf i+(1-u^2)\\mathbf j+12\\mathbf k$ and $u(t)=t^3$, find $(\\mathbf f\\circ u)'(t)$."] [17592186115685 :question/worked-solution "Differentiate the outer function: $\\mathbf f'(u)=-\\sin u\\,\\mathbf i-2u\\mathbf j$. The inner derivative is $u'(t)=3t^2$. Therefore $$(\\mathbf f\\circ u)'(t)=(-\\sin(t^3)\\mathbf i-2t^3\\mathbf j)3t^2=-3t^2\\sin(t^3)\\mathbf i-6t^5\\mathbf j.$$"] [17592186115685 :question/difficulty 17592186045465] [17592186114885 :question/problem "Find $\\big( u(t) \\mathbf g(t) \\big)'$ where $[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡t \\\\ -t \\\\ {e}^{2t}\\end{aligned}]$ and $u(t) = t.$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186113451 17592186113452 17592186113453 17592186113454 17592186113455 17592186113511 17592186113512 17592186113513 17592186113514 17592186113515 17592186113517 17592186113518 17592186113519 17592186113520 17592186113521 17592186305617 17592186305618 17592186305619 17592186305620 17592186305621 17592186305645 17592186305646 17592186305647 17592186305648 17592186305649 17592186305673 17592186305674 17592186305675 17592186305676 17592186305677 17592186305722 17592186305723 17592186305724 17592186305725 17592186305726] "immutable_fields" [[17592186113450 :answer-field/correct] [17592186113450 :answer-field/id] [17592186113450 :answer-field/key] [17592186113450 :answer-field/type] [17592186113510 :answer-field/correct] [17592186113510 :answer-field/id] [17592186113510 :answer-field/key] [17592186113510 :answer-field/type] [17592186113516 :answer-field/correct] [17592186113516 :answer-field/id] [17592186113516 :answer-field/key] [17592186113516 :answer-field/type] [17592186305616 :answer-field/correct] [17592186305616 :answer-field/id] [17592186305616 :answer-field/key] [17592186305616 :answer-field/type] [17592186305644 :answer-field/correct] [17592186305644 :answer-field/id] [17592186305644 :answer-field/key] [17592186305644 :answer-field/type] [17592186305672 :answer-field/correct] [17592186305672 :answer-field/id] [17592186305672 :answer-field/key] [17592186305672 :answer-field/type] [17592186305721 :answer-field/correct] [17592186305721 :answer-field/id] [17592186305721 :answer-field/key] [17592186305721 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
